{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2>Oh no! Bloom locked herself inside! Solve puzzles, clear minigames, and overcome obstacles to help her get out!<br><br>Full Bloom is a cute<span class=\"bb_spoiler\">psychological horror</span>adventure game with puzzle and minigame<span class=\"bb_spoiler\">and survival</span>elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles!</h2>Getting out won't be easy. You'll have to solve lots of puzzles! Help Bloom figure out what to do!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/2c30c959265fd0720c0a53e933ae644d.poster.avif?t=1729012251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/2c30c959265fd0720c0a53e933ae644d.webm?t=1729012251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/2c30c959265fd0720c0a53e933ae644d.mp4?t=1729012251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Minigames!</h2>Being stuck in a room all day is boring... so let's make it more fun with minigames!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/8d57fcb5ae334a3eaed6d09e4f6979ce.avif?t=1729012251\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2>D\u0335\u0357\u0354o\u0335\u030e\u0316n\u0336\u0310\u031e'\u0334\u030c\u035at\u0336\u0307\u0329 \u0336\u030c\u0328g\u0335\u031a\u0320o\u0337\u0340\u032e \u0337\u0304\u033ao\u0337\u0313\u0355u\u0336\u0312\u0329t\u0337\u0343\u0330 \u0334\u0306\u0349t\u0334\u035d\u033ah\u0336\u0311\u035ae\u0337\u0303\u032dr\u0337\u0304\u0326e\u0338\u0307\u032c.\u0335\u0313\u0356<br><br>Rummage through strange, decrepit locations. There is no destination. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/d41873d75408bc1661d15b455e2a133d.avif?t=1729012251\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/523fc7b0a39e987d54eb0197feaddc3f.avif?t=1729012251\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2>P\u0336\u033e\u032cl\u0334\u0301\u033ce\u0334\u030c\u0345a\u0338\u0344\u0354s\u0337\u0301\u033ce\u0334\u0343\u0355.\u0335\u0305\u031f<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/063f1a5b3f052254d533005485884f23.poster.avif?t=1729012251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/063f1a5b3f052254d533005485884f23.webm?t=1729012251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/063f1a5b3f052254d533005485884f23.mp4?t=1729012251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br>I\u0338\u030c\u032dt\u0337\u0309\u034b\u0325\u033a\u0318\u0348'\u0334\u031a\u0343\u030a\u031e\u0356\u032ds\u0335\u030b\u0344\u030a\u035d\u0327\u0332\u0329\u0345 \u0334\u0360\u030c\u0331\u0321o\u0336\u0305\u033d\u031c\u0323k\u0334\u030b\u0358\u0327\u0316\u0322a\u0335\u0357\u0347\u032f\u0319y\u0336\u0305\u0353\u031c\u031e<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/72416a7690554ca9ee9744ad74db5572.poster.avif?t=1729012251\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624090/extras/72416a7690554ca9ee9744ad74db5572.webm?t=1729012251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati